@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Student
actor Administrator
actor System

rectangle "Smart Campus System" {
  usecase "View availability" as UC1
  usecase "Book room" as UC2
  usecase "Cancel booking" as UC3
  usecase "Send confirmation" as UC4
  usecase "Block / unblock room" as UC5
  usecase "Review usage" as UC6
  usecase "Login to system" as UC7
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3
Student --> UC4
Student --> UC7

Administrator --> UC5
Administrator --> UC6
Administrator --> UC7
Administrator --> UC2

UC2 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
System --> UC4

note bottom of UC2
  Assumptions:
  1. Room booking duration is up to 2 hours.
  2. Overlapping active bookings are prevented.
  3. Confirmation is sent via email or notification.
end note
@enduml
